{"id":55273,"date":"2026-07-30T14:49:16","date_gmt":"2026-07-30T13:49:16","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/8o-edicao-sao-joao-da-degola\/"},"modified":"2026-09-06T20:43:16","modified_gmt":"2026-09-06T19:43:16","slug":"8o-edicao-sao-joao-da-degola","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/8o-edicao-sao-joao-da-degola\/","title":{"rendered":"8\u00ba Edic\u00e3o S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Degola 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">8\u00ba Edic\u00e3o S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Degola 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>8\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Corrida e Marcha Passeio de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Degola 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 um emblem\u00e1tico evento de atletismo e conv\u00edvio popular realizado na deslumbrante vila balnear da <strong>Manta Rota<\/strong>, freguesia de <strong>Vila Nova de Cacela<\/strong> e concelho de <strong>Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Benefic\u00eancia A Manta<\/strong> em estreita parceria t\u00e9cnica com o <strong>Campesino Trail<\/strong> e os <strong>Morcegos de Cacela<\/strong>, a iniciativa integra as festividades tradicionais de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Degola, unindo desporto, solidariedade e dinamiza\u00e7\u00e3o comunit\u00e1ria no sotavento algarvio.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e meta instaladas no ic\u00f3nico <strong>Largo S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Degola<\/strong>, os participantes desafiam um tra\u00e7ado de <strong>10 km<\/strong> na corrida competitiva ou de <strong>7 km<\/strong> na marcha passeio, cruzando passadi\u00e7os litorais, pisos de terra batida, asfalto e trechos de areia caracter\u00edsticos da orla costeira. O evento disp\u00f5e de abastecimentos aos 4,5 km e 7,5 km, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica com chip atrav\u00e9s da plataforma <strong>Acorrer.pt<\/strong>, medalha de finisher para a corrida e t-shirt t\u00e9cnica comemorativa para os inscritos, premiando os melhores atletas absolutos e dos v\u00e1rios escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\