14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Benefic\u00eancia A Manta, Campesino Trail e Morcegos Cacela<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">2 horas<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 23 Ago \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Geral:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Filiados AA Algarve:<\/strong> 11.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Marcha Passeio 7 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 23 Ago \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Sem T-Shirt:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Com T-Shirt T\u00e9cnica:<\/strong> 7.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual foi a data e local de realiza\u00e7\u00e3o da 8\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Degola 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realizou-se no domingo, 23 de agosto de 2026, com partida marcada para as 09:00 no Largo S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Degola, na localidade da Manta Rota, freguesia de Vila Nova de Cacela, concelho de Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais foram as dist\u00e2ncias e tipos de piso do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova contou com a Corrida de 10 km cronometrada e a Marcha Passeio de 7 km em ritmo livre, percorrendo um itiner\u00e1rio diversificado que combinou passadi\u00e7os de madeira, caminhos de terra, alcatr\u00e3o e trechos de areal na zona costeira da Manta Rota.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e tempos oficiais da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es completas com tempos por escal\u00e3o, tempos de passagem e diplomas de participa\u00e7\u00e3o encontram-se dispon\u00edveis para consulta na plataforma oficial de cronometragem Acorrer.pt e no portal Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais foram os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e condi\u00e7\u00f5es de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Corrida de 10 km teve o valor de 14,00 \u20ac, beneficiando de um desconto de 3,00 \u20ac para atletas filiados na Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve. A Marcha Passeio teve participa\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita, ou o custo de 7,00 \u20ac para quem optou por adquirir a t-shirt t\u00e9cnica comemorativa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem promoveu a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o e qual o cariz da iniciativa?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento foi promovido pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Benefic\u00eancia A Manta em parceria com o Campesino Trail e os Morcegos de Cacela, integrando um cariz solid\u00e1rio no \u00e2mbito das festas populares de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Degola.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"8\u00ba Edic\u00e3o S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Degola 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-08-23\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Largo S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Degola, Manta Rota\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio\", \"addressRegion\": \"Faro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Benefic\u00eancia A Manta, Campesino Trail e Morcegos Cacela\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual foi a data e local de realiza\u00e7\u00e3o da 8\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Degola 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realizou-se no domingo, 23 de agosto de 2026, com partida marcada para as 09:00 no Largo S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Degola, na localidade da Manta Rota, freguesia de Vila Nova de Cacela, concelho de Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais foram as dist\u00e2ncias e tipos de piso do percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova contou com a Corrida de 10 km cronometrada e a Marcha Passeio de 7 km em ritmo livre, percorrendo um itiner\u00e1rio diversificado que combinou passadi\u00e7os de madeira, caminhos de terra, alcatr\u00e3o e trechos de areal na zona costeira da Manta Rota.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e tempos oficiais da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es completas com tempos por escal\u00e3o, tempos de passagem e diplomas de participa\u00e7\u00e3o encontram-se dispon\u00edveis para consulta na plataforma oficial de cronometragem Acorrer.pt e no portal Portugal Running.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais foram os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e condi\u00e7\u00f5es de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Corrida de 10 km teve o valor de 14,00 \u20ac, beneficiando de um desconto de 3,00 \u20ac para atletas filiados na Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve. A Marcha Passeio teve participa\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita, ou o custo de 7,00 \u20ac para quem optou por adquirir a t-shirt t\u00e9cnica comemorativa.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem promoveu a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o e qual o cariz da iniciativa?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento foi promovido pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Benefic\u00eancia A Manta em parceria com o Campesino Trail e os Morcegos de Cacela, integrando um cariz solid\u00e1rio no \u00e2mbito das festas populares de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Degola.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67285,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28],"event_type_2":[728,149,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-55273","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-pub